  4) rel_str_xau_60       excess 60d total return over XAU (risk-off relative)
  5) vol_perc_252         percentile of 20d realized vol within trailing 252d
  6) gain_loss_ratio_60   mean(pos ret)/|mean(neg ret)| over 60d (asymmetry)
  7) atr_ratio_20_60      mean(TR,20)/mean(TR,60)-1 (ATR trend ratio)
  8) ndx_beta_60          rolling beta to NDX (tech beta)

Gate: |IC| >= 0.007, |ICIR| >= 0.084 (h=10, 2020-01-01..2026-07-15),
plus max abs pairwise mean-daily-Spearman rho vs the 12 current library
factors must be < 0.5 (redundancy admission contract).
